title: Coalitions
new-page: true
is-card: true
is-pinned-card: true
card-image: img/chamber.jpg
on-arrival: {!
if (typeof Q.syncCoalitionOptions === 'function') { Q.syncCoalitionOptions() }
!}
on-display: {!
if (typeof Q.renderCoalitionDistrictList === 'function') { Q.renderCoalitionDistrictList() }
!}

= District coalitions

Megacorps and syndicates rarely lose every seat, but they often lose an **outright majority**. When that happens you can **tolerate** their leadership — prop them up while extracting leverage — or use your **マ** to **control** the district.

[? if pp_any_coalition_possible = 0: No district council currently needs a coalition deal. ?]

{!<div class="coalition-district-list"></div>!}

- @docks_toleration: D1 Docks — tolerate [+ pp_toleration_faction_Docks +]
- @docks_control: D1 Docks — control ([+ pp_control_cost_Docks +] マ)
- @aurora_control: D2 Aurora — control ([+ pp_control_cost_Aurora +] マ)
- @vats_toleration: D3 Vats — tolerate [+ pp_toleration_faction_Vats +]
- @vats_control: D3 Vats — control ([+ pp_control_cost_Vats +] マ)
- @railyard_toleration: D4 Railyard — tolerate [+ pp_toleration_faction_Railyard +]
- @railyard_control: D4 Railyard — control ([+ pp_control_cost_Railyard +] マ)
- @pitts_toleration: D5 Pitts — tolerate [+ pp_toleration_faction_Pitts +]
- @pitts_control: D5 Pitts — control ([+ pp_control_cost_Pitts +] マ)
- @limelight_toleration: D6 Limelight — tolerate [+ pp_toleration_faction_Limelight +]
- @limelight_control: D6 Limelight — control ([+ pp_control_cost_Limelight +] マ)
- @deeps_control: D7 Deeps — control ([+ pp_control_cost_Deeps +] マ)
- @return

@docks_toleration
view-if: pp_toleration_possible_Docks = 1
on-arrival: {! if (typeof Q.ppApplyToleration === 'function') { Q.ppApplyToleration('Docks') } !}
go-to: coalitions

@docks_control
view-if: pp_toleration_possible_Docks = 1
choose-if: pp_control_affordable_Docks = 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough マ
on-arrival: {! if (typeof Q.ppApplyControl === 'function') { Q.ppApplyControl('Docks') } !}
go-to: coalitions

